# Dustwallow Marsh (43-44): the Horde quests of Brackenwall Village and the Wyrmbog, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/dustwallow_marsh_43_44.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Dustwallow Marsh, area 15).
# The guide's quest list is section 5 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md; the later
# Dustwallow quests (The Brood of Onyxia 1172, Tiara of the Deep) are in Tanaris & Dustwallow Marsh
# (47-48).
# Carried in: Marg Speaks (1261), taken from the Bubbling Cauldron at Grom'gol in Stranglethorn Vale
# (Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (41-43)); its Jeweled Pendant drops from the Muckshells here.
#
# The route: a flight from Gadgetzan to Brackenwall; one long loop south into the Wyrmbog (the
# goblin camp, Stonemaul Ruins, the Den of Flame, the Bloodfen raptors, the whelp hills) and the
# Muckshell coast; back to Brackenwall; a flight to Orgrimmar for Zor Lonetree and level 44 training;
# back to Gadgetzan for the next guide.

guide Dustwallow Marsh (43-44)
faction horde
levels 43 44
carry 1118 1261 94895
leave 1118 94895
next Tanaris (44-44)

# Gadgetzan -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Tanaris
fly "Brackenwall Village" npc 7824
tip If Brackenwall is not on your flight map yet, fly to Camp Taurajo and ride east into the marsh.

# Brackenwall Village -------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Dustwallow Marsh
fpath 11899
accept 1166
tip The ogre overlord sits on his throne in the middle of the village.
accept 98192
accept 1168
accept 1169
tip Draz'Zilb stands in the small cave at the south end of the village.

# The Wyrmbog: the goblin camp ----------------------------------------------------------------------

goto "Ride south into the Wyrmbog, to the goblin camp among the whelps" at 41.0,75.2 r 30
accept 98205 98215
accept 98231
tip Drazzit and Gizzix stand by their pack kodo, Miss Melly.

# Stonemaul Ruins, the Den of Flame and the Bloodfen raptors ---------------------------------------------

do 98215 bg
tip Black Shed Dark Dragonscales lie on the ground everywhere in the Wyrmbog; the dragonkin drop them too.
do 1169 bg
do 98205 bg
do 1168.1 bg
do 1168.2 bg
do 1166.1
tip The snuff sits in Stonemaul Ruins, the old ogre village north of the goblins, now full of Firemane dragonkin.
do 1168.1
do 1168.2
do 1166.2
tip The grog is by the mouth of the Den of Flame, the cave west of Stonemaul Ruins.
do 1168.3
tip The Firemane Scalebanes guard the Den of Flame: pull them one at a time.
do 1166.3
tip The strongbox is at the back of the Den of Flame.
do 98192
tip The red Bloodfen raptors roam the Dragonmurk, just west of the Den of Flame.

# The whelp hills south of the goblins ---------------------------------------------------------------

do 98231
tip Wyrmtail is a small plant growing among the whelps, most of it east of the goblin camp.
do 98205
do 1169
tip Tongues and hearts drop from both the hatchlings and the whelps.
do 98215
turnin 98205 98215
turnin 98231

# The Muckshell coast ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 1261 mobs 4405 4404 4403 4401 4402 14236 at 56.0,63.5
tip Every Muckshell can drop the pendant, but only about one in twenty does: each of you needs one, so keep killing.

# Brackenwall Village ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

goto "Ride back north to Brackenwall Village" at 36.4,31.5 r 30
turnin 1166
turnin 1168
turnin 98192
turnin 1169
accept 1170
turnin 1170
accept 1171
turnin 1171
tip Leave the next Brood of Onyxia quest for later: a later guide does it.
turnin 1261
accept 1262

# Orgrimmar -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Orgrimmar, Durotar" npc 11899
map Orgrimmar
turnin 1262
tip Zor Lonetree stands in the Valley of Wisdom.
accept 7541
turnin 7541
train 3353 3352 3401 6014 3344 5882 3326
tip Paladins and druids have no trainer here: paladins train in Undercity or Thunder Bluff, druids in Thunder Bluff.
hearth npc 7733
tip The next guide starts in Gadgetzan. If your hearthstone is not set there, take a wind rider from Doras, on the tower by the Valley of Strength.
